This distribution changes the upstream ESP32 firmware to add the ATOMS3R +
Atomic Echo Base board, MiniMax streaming speech and persistent voice selection,
Shadowsocks 2022 TCP routing, PNG/JPEG reply display and private base64 image
delivery, bounded control-message reassembly, and private build configuration.
These additions are licensed under Apache-2.0 except vendored dependencies
with their own retained licenses. This is an independent community adaptation.
Muse and M5Stack names identify compatible services and hardware.
